OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire Wolds AONB plan
OL,4,Asubmitted to government
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposal to make the Yorkshire Wolds
OL,7,Fan Area of Outstanding Natural Beauty
OL,8,F(AONB) has been submitted to the
OL,9,Fgovernment.
OL,11,FIf approved, it would mean the area
OL,12,Fwould be given some legal protections
OL,13,Fregarding development and conservation.
OL,15,FNatural England has submitted the plan
OL,16,Fto Environment, Food and Rural Affairs
OL,17,FSecretary Dame Angela Eagle.
OL,19,FIf the idea goes ahead, the AONB would
OL,20,Fcover about 180 sq miles (465 sq km).
